746
00:36:13,297 --> 00:36:15,424
So it means one of them is her ex-husband.

747
00:36:17,718 --> 00:36:18,760
I see.

748
00:36:19,761 --> 00:36:20,637
I see.

749
00:36:21,305 --> 00:36:23,682
