to cover those expenses as well.

781
00:38:27,180 --> 00:38:33,520
Eventually, he started gradually
dipping into our household budget.

782
00:38:33,603 --> 00:38:36,356
It was already hard when he wasn't
making money,

783
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:40,318
but now I had to support four people
with just my salary.

784
00:38:40,402 --> 00:38:45,782
We dipped into our savings
to pay the rent.

785
00:38:46,533 --> 00:38:48,076
But the breaking point

786
00:38:48,618 --> 00:38:52,330
was when he secretly moved money around

787
00:38:52,414 --> 00:38:55,584
