795
00:39:20,734 --> 00:39:24,654
Why do you want to sell it?"

796
00:39:24,738 --> 00:39:28,075
He told me it would be better to spend
that money on our living expenses.

797
00:39:28,158 --> 00:39:31,203
So, he said he wanted to spend the money
on our living expenses,

798
00:39:31,286 --> 00:39:34,539
so when I found out he was secretly
moving that money around

799
00:39:34,623 --> 00:39:38,919
despite saying we needed the money
for our living expenses,

800
00:39:39,002 --> 00:39:41,254
I realized I could never trust him again.

801
00:39:41,338 --> 00:39:45,842
I eventually realized that staying
with him would only lead me to ruin.

802
00:39:47,010 --> 00:39:48,095
Cheers.

803
00:39:48,178 --> 00:39:49,221
Who is it already?

804
00:39:49,304 --> 00:39:51,306
Come on, stop teasing us.

805
00:39:52,557 --> 00:39:55,102
